<title>UK: Zeneca says Seroquel has 'approvable' status.</title>
<headline>Zeneca says Seroquel has 'approvable' status.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British pharmaceutical company Zeneca Group  Plc said on Friday that its antipsychotic therapy drug Seroquel had  won 'approvable' status from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration  (FDA).</p>
<p>The company said this was an important step on the way to full approval  for the product, which could come in the third quarter of the year.</p>
</text>
